@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. GET / - Kiem tra trang thai may chu API -> 200 OK
GET {{host}}/

### 2. GET danh sach bai tap -> 200 OK
GET {{host}}/api/assignments

### 3. Tao luot nop hop le -> 201 Created + Header Location
# @name createSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "DTC245140150",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/lesonba/signalr"
}

### 4. Doc lai luot nop vua tao: received -> processing -> graded -> 200 OK
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. POST thieu du lieu (repositoryUrl bi trong) -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "DTC245140150",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 6. POST vao ma bai tap khong ton tai (assignmentId = 999) -> 404 Not Found
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "DTC245140150",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/lesonba/signalr"
}

### 7. GET submissionId khong ton tai / rong -> 404 Not Found
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. Bat tay SignalR Hub thanh cong -> 200 OK + connectionId
POST {{host}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 9. Bat tay SignalR sai duong dan hub (/hub/submissions thieu 's') -> 404 Not Found
POST {{host}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
